title: Warn on invalid files in show and claim across all clients
updated_at: "2026-07-15T06:35:23Z"
---
Implement the invalid-file diagnostic contract in the Go canonical client and Python/TypeScript parity helpers.

Acceptance criteria:
- show validates its resolved file and prints each detected issue without hiding readable content.
- claim validates before mutation, prints all warnings, and preserves the contract for files that are still safe to claim.
- Diagnostics identify the affected path, reason, and a useful next command or remediation.
- Go, Python, and TypeScript behavior is aligned; focused tests for all three clients pass together with the parity suite.